WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.958 --> 00:00:02.833
T-shirts! Get your T-shirts!

00:00:02.917 --> 00:00:03.917
And the White House

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.375
is called
the People's House,

00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:06.458
because in America,

00:00:06.542 --> 00:00:08.333
the government
works for you.

00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:09.792
Bullshit!

00:00:10.292 --> 00:00:11.333
Listen up, kids!

00:00:11.417 --> 00:00:14.083
Everything they teach you
in school is a lie!

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:15.167
You want the truth?

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.500
The world is controlled by
shadowy elites

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:21.000
and shapeshifting
lizard people!

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:23.500
Have you ever folded
a one-dollar bill?

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:25.792
Look!
You can make it say "boobs"!

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:27.750
What does it mean?!

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:30.042
Am I the only one
who cares that the President

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:31.333
is a robot?!

00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:32.750
Wake up, sheeple!

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:34.500
The evidence is right here!

00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:36.708
These sons of bitches
got snipers trained on me

00:00:36.792 --> 00:00:38.125
for trying to
tell you the truth!

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:42.250
Ah, I love being right.

00:00:44.792 --> 00:00:45.750
Thank you!

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:47.625
Take a flyer, for a friend!

00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:50.000
Dad, what the fuck?

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.708
Has retirement made you go
completely insane?

00:00:52.792 --> 00:00:55.833
No, but the 5G radio waves
in the air have,

00:00:55.917 --> 00:00:58.958
which you can read all about
in my new manifesto,

00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:00.458
available on Kindle.

00:01:00.542 --> 00:01:01.583
Oh, Jesus Christ.

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:03.250
Don't listen
to my father, kids!

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:05.250
He gets his news from
Facebook and Ambien.

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:06.750
Ambien's a great drug.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.500
Really clarifies
some things.

00:01:08.583 --> 00:01:10.042
Come on, I'm late for work.

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:15.250
Democracy is real!
Have some keychains.

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:20.708
Hey, Reagan.

00:01:20.792 --> 00:01:22.875
Let's go to the mall
and get a Wetzel's pretzel.

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:26.083
They got those ones with
the cheese inside the crust.

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:28.250
Dad, I know
retirement is tough,

00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:29.667
but there's
more positive ways

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:30.958
to get my attention than

00:01:31.042 --> 00:01:32.833
"taking down
the deep state."

00:01:33.542 --> 00:01:36.708
Besides, today, I am finally
getting that promotion!

00:01:36.792 --> 00:01:37.625
Imagine it.

00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:40.458
Me, ruling the office
with an iron fist!

00:01:40.542 --> 00:01:42.583
I even programmed
an iron fist!

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:44.208
I've seen better.

00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:46.000
Oh, have you seen better?

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:50.917
Alright, that's pretty good.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.375
Yeah, that is
pretty good, huh?

00:01:55.083 --> 00:01:56.792
Welcome to Cognito, Inc.

00:01:57.542 --> 00:01:58.625
We are a company.

00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:00.292
We are…

00:02:00.375 --> 00:02:02.000
Good morning, Dr Ridley.

00:02:02.083 --> 00:02:03.208
We are a company.

00:02:03.292 --> 00:02:05.417
Look, Dad, as long as
you're living with me,

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.542
we need some ground rules.

00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:09.042
First, no more
vodka for breakfast.

00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:10.167
Aw, come on!

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:13.250
You can't tell people that
the government isn't real.

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:14.375
But it's not!

00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:15.458
Dr Ridley?

00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:25.292
You can't talk about
shapeshifting reptiles.

00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:27.625
-Good morning, Senator!
-Revenues, and, uh…

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:30.875
You can't tell people

00:02:30.958 --> 00:02:33.417
the weather is controlled
by Gerald from Accounting,

00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:35.875
or that the Dow Jones

00:02:35.958 --> 00:02:37.875
is controlled
by blood sacrifices.

00:02:37.958 --> 00:02:42.167
Shares of JPMorgan Chase
up 14 points!

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.292
Whoo!

00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:44.750
Rules, rules, rules.

00:02:44.833 --> 00:02:47.125
When did this become
such a boring place to work?

00:02:49.625 --> 00:02:51.083
Morning, Dr Ridley!

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:53.125
-Hi, Steve.
-Hi, Steve.

00:02:53.208 --> 00:02:54.458
Fucking brown-noser.

00:02:54.542 --> 00:02:55.750
And most importantly,

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:58.083
you absolutely
cannot tell people

00:02:58.167 --> 00:02:59.667
that we're replacing
the President

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:00.625
with a robot, okay?

00:03:03.958 --> 00:03:06.625
Ah, don't be so uptight.

00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:09.042
Uptight? You almost
exposed the deep state

00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:11.250
because you wanted
a ride to Wetzel's Pretzels!

00:03:11.333 --> 00:03:13.292
You're lucky
I called the snipers off!

00:03:13.792 --> 00:03:15.500
Gary, no. No!

00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:18.667
Ha ha. Save it for
stand-up night, Gary.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.708
Shit, I'm late.

00:03:19.792 --> 00:03:20.750
Hey! Intern guy.

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:22.708
Take my dad home.
If he gives you trouble,

00:03:22.792 --> 00:03:24.917
don't be afraid to
lightly tase him.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.375
Do it, I fucking dare you.

00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:29.125
You know who I am? I'm
Rand motherfucking Ridley,

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:31.042
and I used to
run this company.

00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:33.625
And soon,
I will be running it.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.000
Nothing higher than a three!

00:03:36.542 --> 00:03:37.542
Later, Dad!

00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:38.750
Motherfucker!

